# Coordination service origin.
#
# NOTE: do NOT include /v1 — the SDK's documented paths (session-protocol §4.2)
# already carry it, so a base of `https://host` and `https://host/` behave
# identically and neither should append the version.
#
# Anything VITE_-prefixed is inlined into the client bundle and is therefore
# PUBLIC. Never put a secret here.
#
# The browser must trust the coordination cert's CA before any call succeeds.
# It is signed by a local CA (`sentry-core/tls/ca.crt`, CN=Kallon Sentry Local
# CA) and the URL must match a SAN on it — an IP, not a hostname. Visit
# <url>/healthz once and click through, or install ca.crt into the OS trusted
# root store. A bare "Failed to fetch" with NO HTTP status is this, not a bug.
VITE_COORDINATION_URL=https://192.168.1.230:8081

# Extra media origins for the CSP `media-src`, space- or comma-separated.
#
# REQUIRED FOR THE DATA CENTRE BUILD (sentri.watch). Playback plays archived
# segments in a <video>. On the DC the segment URL is a PRESIGNED BUCKET URL, so
# its origin is the object store, not coordination, and without it named here the
# browser blocks the player:
#
#   Loading media from 'https://s3.us-east-005.backblazeb2.com/...' violates the
#   following Content Security Policy directive: "media-src 'self' blob:
#   https://coord.example:9081". The action has been blocked.
#
# The value is the ORIGIN of the DC's DC_B2_ENDPOINT (sentry-core device.env on the
# DC). Those two must agree: change the bucket provider or region and this changes
# with it, which is why it is configuration and not a constant in vite.config.ts.
#
# LEAVE UNSET for the HUB build (scripts/build-hub-dashboard.sh). There the segment
# stream IS coordination, same-origin, and the hub must not acquire a cloud origin
# it never talks to. test/csp.test.mjs pins both cases.
#
# vite.config.ts folds these into media-src at build: reduced to origins, paths and
# trailing slashes dropped, unparseable entries discarded, no wildcards possible.
#VITE_MEDIA_ORIGINS=https://s3.us-east-005.backblazeb2.com
